From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Kleinschmidt <jkleinsc@electronjs.org>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: feat: add protobuf output and perfetto config modifier to
 TracingController

Extends content::TracingController::StartTracing with a StartTracingOptions
struct that lets embedders request raw protobuf trace output and add data
sources (such as Chromium's trace-scoped native heap profiler) to the
perfetto config used by the shared tracing session.

This allows heap samples to be collected alongside the other tracing
categories in a single session rather than requiring a separate
perfetto::TracingSession on the embedder side.

For protobuf output the tracing session waits for the
OnTracingDisabled callback before reading buffers, since the heap profiler
completes its final sample asynchronously while the data source is being
disabled.

The file endpoint is also switched to binary mode so protobuf traces are
not corrupted on Windows.

This should be upstreamed.

